sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Player (mobile portrait)
    participant CR as Component.razor (Blazor WASM)
    participant FC as FluentValidation (client)
    participant TH as Typed HttpClient (Polly resilient)
    participant BA as BFF Cookie Auth Middleware
    participant SV as StartupSecretValidator (cold path)
    participant EP as Minimal API Feature Handler
    participant VS as Validator (server, DataAnnotations)
    participant ST as Storage Repository (Table Storage)
    participant AZ as Azure Table Storage (Azurite dev / Azure prod)
    participant LG as LoggerMessage (zero-alloc source-gen)

    U->>CR: Tap "Submit score"
    CR->>FC: Validate SubmitScoreRequest (client rules)
    alt Client validation fails
        FC-->>CR: ValidationMessage rendered
        CR-->>U: Inline error (no network call)
    else Client validation passes
        CR->>TH: POST /api/leaderboard {score, gameId}
        TH->>TH: Polly retry + timeout pipeline
        TH->>BA: HTTP request (carries HttpOnly cookie)
        BA->>BA: MicrosoftAuth or FakeAuth scheme
        alt Unauthenticated
            BA-->>TH: 401 Unauthorized
            TH-->>CR: Surface auth error
            CR-->>U: Redirect to LoginScreen
        else Authenticated
            BA->>SV: First-request secret validation (prod only)
            SV-->>BA: OK
            BA->>EP: Forward to /api/leaderboard handler
            EP->>VS: Validate DTO (trim-safe POCO)
            alt DTO invalid
                VS-->>EP: ValidationException
                EP-->>TH: 400 ProblemDetails (RFC 7807)
                TH-->>CR: Typed client throws
                CR->>LG: Log Warning EventId 2003 bad-dto
            else DTO valid
                EP->>ST: UPSERT (PartitionKey, RowKey)
                ST->>AZ: TableTransactionAction.Upsert
                alt Transient fault
                    AZ-->>ST: Throttled / Timeout
                    ST-->>EP: 503 + Retry-After
                    EP->>LG: Log Warning EventId 2004 transient
                    TH->>TH: Polly retries per policy
                else Success
                    AZ-->>ST: 200 OK with ETag
                    ST-->>EP: new entity
                    EP-->>TH: 200 OK DTO (System.Text.Json source-gen)
                    TH-->>CR: Update PlayerStatsViewModel
                    CR->>LG: Log Information EventId 2001 score-submitted
                    CR-->>U: Render new rank + Elo
                end
            end
        end
    end